<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin-right: 0; margin-left: 0"></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin-right: 0; margin-left: 0"><FONT STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">(the
steps above shall be collectively referred to as the &ldquo;Capital Reduction and Reorganization&rdquo;)</FONT></P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
