<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">We
file annual report and other documents with the SEC under the Exchange Act. Our SEC filings made electronically through the SEC&rsquo;s
EDGAR system are available to the public at the SEC&rsquo;s website at http://www.sec.gov. You may also read and copy any document
we file with the SEC at the SEC&rsquo;s public reference room located at 100 F Street, NE, Room 1580, Washington, DC 20549. Please
call the SEC at +1 (800) SEC-0330 for further information on the operation of the public reference room.</FONT></P>

