in one or more instruments each signed by one or more of the Members and the <FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: -0.05pt">effective </FONT>date
of the Special Resolution so adopted shall be the date on which the instrument or the last of such instruments, if more than one, is
executed;</FONT></TD></TR>
</TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0pt 0 0"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

