<TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; padding-right: 0pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">a
company is a subsidiary of another company if that other company:</FONT></TD></TR>
