<TD STYLE="text-align: justify; padding-right: 0pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">authorize
any person to enter on behalf of all the Members concerned into an agreement with the Company providing for the allotment of them <FONT STYLE="letter-spacing: -0.05pt">respectively,
</FONT>credited as fully paid, of any shares or debentures to which they may be entitled upon such capitalization, any agreement made
under such authority being binding on all such Members. &nbsp;</FONT></TD></TR>
