<TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; padding-right: 0pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">electronic
mail, shall be deemed to have been served immediately upon the time of the transmission by electronic mail; or</FONT></TD></TR>
</TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0pt 0 0"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

